<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Q1 profit 204 mln ecus.</title>
<headline>Fortis Q1 profit 204 mln ecus.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of ECUs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		   204    vs 157</p>
<p>    Total income (billion)	     5.25 vs   4.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   321    vs 243</p>
<p>    Taxes				    92     vs     67</p>
<p>    Minorities' charge		   48     vs     41</p>
<p>    Net equity (billion)		  6.55  vs	5.92</p>
<p>    Total assets (billion)	    148.66  vs    141.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Dutch-Belgian bank/insurer Fortis to post a profit increase of almost 18 percent to 185 million ECUs in the first three months of 1997.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
